(new)`\n\n\n\n## 先读输入\n\n- `docs/2026-09-09-gnss-event-report.md`\n\n\n\n## 本票前置\n\n无本票额外开放依赖；运行前仍须完成脚本资源/身份检查。\n\n原父票依赖仍为 #22, #23。本子票仅按自身真实前置派发，父票关闭规则不变。\n\n\n\n## 操作步骤\n\n1. Read actual gps_arguments/send_sensors and retain original 13-field GPS source tuple\n\n2. Add explicit optional event hook before hil_gps_send; record attempted/success/error separately and leave IMU/resend semantics intact\n\n3. Test exact event boundaries, original source time, duplicate GPS suppression, no-event regression and new epoch\n\n\n\n## 完成条件\n\n- [ ] One bounded real send-boundary seam, test proves GNSS-specific suppression without altering physical truth or IMU.\n\n- [ ] 交付源码/配置身份、准确命令、原始结果和失败边界；仅关闭本子票。\n\n\n\n## 命令入口\n\n这是实现/契约切片。新增入口、测试命令和输出schema属于交付物；当前不宣称尚未创建的脚本可以运行。\n\n\n\n## 失败处理\n\n保存本次新证据，保持票据 OPEN，移到 needs-triage 并写清实际错误。源码身份、物理预算或写入范围变化交 Astra 复核；已授权的普通读写/检查不反复请求用户许可。\n\n父票关闭另核对原AC、原依赖和全部必要证明。子票通过不等于物理/Full通过；R1、RateUnmet与旧失败记录保持原状。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unununnnn/wksim/issues/110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unununnnn/wksim/issues/110/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unununnnn/wksim/issues/109","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unununnnn/wksim","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unununnnn/wksim/issues/109/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unununnnn/wksim/issues/109/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unununnnn/wksim/issues/109/events","html_url":"https://github.com/unununnnn/wksim/issues/109","id":5395759874,"node_id":"I_kwDOUO3g_M8AAAABQZzDAg","number":109,"title":"[Astra] 实现AP权威tick的原生GNSS中断候选","user":{"login":"unununnnn","id":107021589,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmEFFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107021589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https